If <sway> element is present, the lateral offset follows the sway."""@en .

odr:T_road_lanes_laneSection_lcr_lane_roadMark_explicit_line.width a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "width"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Line width. This attribute supersedes the definition in the <roadMark> element."@en ;
